 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "requestTime lists arrival times in seconds, sorted non-decreasingly; request i arrives at requestTime[i]. Request i is dropped when any limit is already used up by earlier requests (dropped or not): at least 3 earlier requests arrived in the same second; or at least 20 earlier requests arrived less than 10 seconds before it (requestTime[i] - requestTime[j] < 10); or at least 60 earlier requests arrived less than 60 seconds before it. Return the number of dropped requests (each counted once).",
